  "created": "2026-03-27T09:47:24.03Z",
  "description": "OAuth 2.0 authentication for .NET MAUI with Salesforce, Okta, Azure AD, and any SSO IDP.\n\nFeatures:\n- OAuth 2.0 login via browser (LoginWithOAuth2) — works with any SAML/OIDC identity provider\n- Okta username/password + MFA login (Login)\n- Full SSO logout (LogoutAsync) — revokes SF tokens, clears stored session, and clears IDP cookies\n- iOS: ephemeral browser sessions (no cached SSO cookies, no browser tabs on logout)\n- Android: Chrome Custom Tab logout to clear Salesforce + IDP session cookies\n- Set \"IdpLogoutUrl\" in SecureStorage to your IDP's signout URL (supports comma-separated multiple IDPs)\n- Cross-platform: iOS, Android, Mac Catalyst",
  "id": "StarKnowledge.OAuth.Maui.OktaSalesforce",
